<title>HONG KONG: ABN AMRO sets warrants on HSBC.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO sets warrants on HSBC.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Bank N.V. said on Thursday it launched 20 million American-style call warrants on shares of HSBC Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$186.0	PREMIUM	   14.7 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$2.73	 GEARING	   6.8X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  13.FEB.98     EXER LOT	  2,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG     LAUNCH DATE     13.FEB.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$186.0	PAYMENT DATE    25.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING DATE	28.FEB.97</p>
<p>NOTE: NO PRIMARY SALES ARE PERMITTED INTO U.S.; STANDARD HONG</p>
<p>	 KONG, NETHERLANDS, U.K. AND JAPAN SELLING RESTRICTIONS</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
